{{!
    @template local_learningjourney/partial_stars

    Star rating with a visually hidden text equivalent. The stars themselves are
    decorative, so the meaning is carried entirely by the hidden text.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * starlist array One entry per possible star.
    * starlist[].earned bool Whether this star has been earned.
    * arialabel string Accessible description of the rating.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "arialabel": "3 out of 5 stars",
        "starlist": [
            {"earned": true}, {"earned": true}, {"earned": true},
            {"earned": false}, {"earned": false}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="ljy-stars">
    <span class="ljy-visually-hidden">{{arialabel}}</span>
    <span class="ljy-stars__row" aria-hidden="true">
        {{#starlist}}
            <span class="ljy-star {{#earned}}ljy-star--earned{{/earned}}">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path fill="currentColor" d="m12 2 3 6.6 7 .6-5.3 4.6 1.6 7L12 17l-6.3 3.8 1.6-7L2 9.2l7-.6z"/>
                </svg>
            </span>
        {{/starlist}}
    </span>
</div>
